cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these benchmarks, please cite them using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "pdft-benchmarks: reproduction suite for Fast Trainable Multilinear Bases for Image Compression"
abstract: >-
  Benchmarks and reproduction scripts for the paper's trainable tensor-network
  image bases: the trained bases, per-image evaluation records, and one section
  script per paper section that re-renders and verifies every table and figure
  (Quick Draw and DIV2K basis comparisons, rate-distortion under a common codec,
  and the training- and initialization-robustness appendices).
